Git

- "a builder in one phase ran `git add -A` and staged half built files from a neighbour phase"
- "a committer with no worktree argument committed into the operator's checkout at `/Users/gdc/gmux`"
* "the second to commit rebased over the first and lost its edits"
* "Two rungs fixed the same false sentence independently" (merge conflict)
* "No trailers of any kind" (Commit message Authored-By:)
* "the operator's repos are read-only" (use temp repos in tests)
*  "Never does: Pushes"

